# Bot1 has Rest in Peace out on turn 1. On turn 3 Faithless Looting makes Bot1 discard Basking Rootwalla and Blazing
# Rootwalla at once (CR 101.4). Each card's discard is its own event with its own replacements, so Bot1 orders madness and
# Rest in Peace once for each (CR 616.1): madness first for Basking Rootwalla, Rest in Peace first for Blazing Rootwalla.
# Only Basking Rootwalla's madness triggers (one ability on the stack), and Bot1 casts it for {0}; Blazing Rootwalla is
# simply exiled. The Island is Bot2's turn-2 discard to hand size.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Rest in Peace
Mountain
Faithless Looting
Basking Rootwalla
Blazing Rootwalla
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Rest in Peace.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Basking Rootwalla; Blazing Rootwalla)
Bot1.Replace(madness)
Bot1.Replace(Rest in Peace)
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Accept

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield = Plains; Mox Pearl; Mountain; Rest in Peace; Basking Rootwalla
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
Exile = Faithless Looting; Island; Blazing Rootwalla
